    "name": "Beneath The Six",
    "steam_appid": 3126880,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to The Six, a magical world where dice define your identity. You\u2019re an adventurer trapped in a timeloop with a chaotic, impish DM. Beneath the surface, a dungeon morphs and shifts every day, hiding secrets and relics that will be the key to your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath The Six is a roguelike experience with a single randomized daily dungeon and 4-player co-op. Collect sets of dice and use them to create and blend fighters, mages or rogues to beat the DM\u2019s daily challenges. Earn rewards to unlock more dice sets, build your collection by trading with friends and, one day, perhaps, escape The Six.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/eebc1667cba985b3a44d271f8b022534.poster.avif?t=1755279539\" width=1232 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/eebc1667cba985b3a44d271f8b022534.webm?t=1755279539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Conquer The Daily Dungeon</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i>The daily dungeon regenerates every 24 hours with new challenges, enemies, secrets and loot, and different dungeons will suit different characters. Your challenge: find the right build for today\u2019s adventure!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/6b2833fbb02470e245dfecf310f2628f.poster.avif?t=1755279539\" width=1232 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/6b2833fbb02470e245dfecf310f2628f.webm?t=1755279539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Collect Dice</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are over 130 unique dice sets to collect, with each making their own distinct combination of characters. Each set holds its own stats, weapons, and skills: combine them to craft diverse and fearsome adventurers. Show off your builds \u2014 and build strategies \u2014 with friends, or quest together to conquer daily and weekly challenges.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/f848c8e94ce39e96c0ec7e75f7d06d45.avif?t=1755279539\" width=1232 height=900 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Challenges &amp; Golden Shards</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily and weekly challenges provide you with a way to earn our in-game currency, Golden Shards. Golden Shards can then be spent on unlocking dice sets in the dice shop, giving you access to even more character build options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/1ff67d92f635fe3ddfa765e3125b0b9f.poster.avif?t=1755279539\" width=1232 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/1ff67d92f635fe3ddfa765e3125b0b9f.webm?t=1755279539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Unique Character Creator</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your dice sets to create unique characters with differing skills, armors, weapons and stats to take on the dungeon. Each dice in a set provides a specific component to your character so you can mix and match them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/018257a1ac5f7a7f55cce4c668605661.poster.avif?t=1755279539\" width=1232 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/018257a1ac5f7a7f55cce4c668605661.webm?t=1755279539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Survive The Daily Arena</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i>Test your build in our brutal arena mode, where each wave gets increasingly difficult, with higher tiered enemies and near-impossible intensity. The arena resets every 24 hours. Compete with your friends for the top spot on the leaderboard!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/72aaf2fb2af97d4c89a9b68220122a6e.poster.avif?t=1755279539\" width=1232 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/72aaf2fb2af97d4c89a9b68220122a6e.webm?t=1755279539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Party Up And Explore With Friends</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath The Six supports 4-player co-op, allowing you to tackle the dangers of the dungeon and arena with backup, and show off your new characters.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to The Six, a magical world where dice define your identity. You\u2019re an adventurer trapped in a timeloop with a chaotic, impish DM. Beneath the surface, a dungeon morphs and shifts every day, hiding secrets and relics that will be the key to your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath The Six is a roguelike experience with a single randomized daily dungeon and 4-player co-op. Collect sets of dice and use them to create and blend fighters, mages or rogues to beat the DM\u2019s daily challenges. Earn rewards to unlock more dice sets, build your collection by trading with friends and, one day, perhaps, escape The Six.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/eebc1667cba985b3a44d271f8b022534.poster.avif?t=1755279539\" width=1232 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/eebc1667cba985b3a44d271f8b022534.webm?t=1755279539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Conquer The Daily Dungeon</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i>The daily dungeon regenerates every 24 hours with new challenges, enemies, secrets and loot, and different dungeons will suit different characters. Your challenge: find the right build for today\u2019s adventure!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/6b2833fbb02470e245dfecf310f2628f.poster.avif?t=1755279539\" width=1232 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/6b2833fbb02470e245dfecf310f2628f.webm?t=1755279539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Collect Dice</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are over 130 unique dice sets to collect, with each making their own distinct combination of characters. Each set holds its own stats, weapons, and skills: combine them to craft diverse and fearsome adventurers. Show off your builds \u2014 and build strategies \u2014 with friends, or quest together to conquer daily and weekly challenges.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/f848c8e94ce39e96c0ec7e75f7d06d45.avif?t=1755279539\" width=1232 height=900 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Challenges &amp; Golden Shards</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily and weekly challenges provide you with a way to earn our in-game currency, Golden Shards. Golden Shards can then be spent on unlocking dice sets in the dice shop, giving you access to even more character build options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/1ff67d92f635fe3ddfa765e3125b0b9f.poster.avif?t=1755279539\" width=1232 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/1ff67d92f635fe3ddfa765e3125b0b9f.webm?t=1755279539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Unique Character Creator</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your dice sets to create unique characters with differing skills, armors, weapons and stats to take on the dungeon. Each dice in a set provides a specific component to your character so you can mix and match them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/018257a1ac5f7a7f55cce4c668605661.poster.avif?t=1755279539\" width=1232 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/018257a1ac5f7a7f55cce4c668605661.webm?t=1755279539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Survive The Daily Arena</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i>Test your build in our brutal arena mode, where each wave gets increasingly difficult, with higher tiered enemies and near-impossible intensity. The arena resets every 24 hours. Compete with your friends for the top spot on the leaderboard!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/72aaf2fb2af97d4c89a9b68220122a6e.poster.avif?t=1755279539\" width=1232 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/72aaf2fb2af97d4c89a9b68220122a6e.webm?t=1755279539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Party Up And Explore With Friends</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath The Six supports 4-player co-op, allowing you to tackle the dangers of the dungeon and arena with backup, and show off your new characters.</p>",
    "short_description": "Beneath The Six is a traditional roguelike set in a fractured world long-forgotten by space and time. Collect powerful dice sets, use them to forge valiant adventurers and explore daily randomized dungeons full of trinkets, traps and treasures.",
